data
  root
    label Raft correctness: four invariants, each derived from one mechanism
    children
      - label Election Safety — at most one leader per term
        children
          - label From: one vote per node per term + majority required
          - label Breaks if: a node double-votes → two leaders in one term
      - label Leader Append-Only — a leader only appends to its own log
        children
          - label From: a leader never overwrites or deletes its own entries
          - label Breaks if: a leader rewrites history → committed entries vanish
      - label Log Matching — same entry at index i ⇒ logs identical up to i
        children
          - label From: the AppendEntries consistency check
          - label Breaks if: divergent logs accept appends → split histories
      - label Leader Completeness — every committed entry is in all later leaders
        children
          - label From: quorum overlap + log-completeness voting rule
          - label Breaks if: a stale candidate wins → acknowledged write lost
